  "original_html": "<h1 id=\"primary-heading\" class=\"sr-only\">Home</h1><div class=\"flex flex-col items-stretch gap-8 md:flex-row\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"px-8 py-10 bg-white rounded-lg shadow flex justify-center items-center\"><div class=\"w-32 h-32 rounded-full overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\"><img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"/img/k/public/c657cb8-13.png\" alt=\"The image representing the Storyteller: About Me badge\"/></div></div><div title=\"Submit documentation to earn this badge\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"px-4 py-2 text-sm rounded-md inline-flex items-center border border-transparent font-medium shadow-sm text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-blue-500 w-full justify-center disabled:opacity-50\">\n  Get Started\n</button></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 w-full px-8 py-10 bg-white rounded-lg shadow \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-0 md:flex-row md:justify-between\"><div class=\"text-center md:text-left space-y-4 md:space-y-2\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold\">Storyteller: About Me</h1><h2 class=\"text-xl \">Micro-Credential</h2></div><div class=\"flex gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 overflow-hidden\"><img class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"https://participate.community/img/k/public/07728ce-f4b6fcc-logo_image-1602513419-National_Writing_Project_Community_Icon%20%282%29.png\" alt=\"The image representing the National Writing Project issuer\"/></div><div><div>Issuer</div><div><a href=\"https://www.nwp.org\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline\">\n              National Writing Project\n            </a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-slate-200\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-y-6\"><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Description</h3><div>You’ve taken a step toward deeper connection by sharing your story. By creating an About Me page, you’ve helped others see who you are beyond your role—and invited them to do the same.</div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">Criteria</h3><div class=\"prose prose-a:text-blue-600 marker:prose-li:text-black first:prose-p:mt-0 prose-p:my-4 last:prose-p:mb-0 text-black leading-normal\"><ol><li><p>\nComplete an About Me page using the provided prompts: – What brought you to this work? – What strengths and resources do you bring? – What brings you joy outside of work?    </p></li><li><p>\nAdd at least one photo or media element (optional but encouraged).    </p></li><li><p>\nPublish your About Me page to your profile.    </p></li></ol></div></div></div></div></div>",
